    "created_at": "2020-09-22T08:34:48Z",
    "updated_at": "2020-09-22T08:34:48Z",
    "body": "Since cookies are not origin-bound it seems more appropriate to give them their own data structure. Or do you see a way to combine them despite that fundamental mismatch? They will need to share some of the keying infrastructure though.",
