    "updated_at": "2020-09-22T14:28:46Z",
    "body": "I didn't look in enough detail to have an opinion about whether the storage structure is the right way to do this; I just wanted to make sure the spec authors were aware of it. I suspect you're right that it's not going to fit, and they'll have to define something new either here or in rfc6265bis.",
